[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "x"
range = [0.1, 0.6]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 0.0
a1 = 0.0
a2 = 1.0
a3 = 1.0
a4 = 0.0
period = 2.0
```

Result (E3): partly. Period 2 (T7): x = 0.055, y = 0.052, heading 11 deg. Reversed c3 at period 1 (T8): x = 0.051, y = -0.042, heading 56 deg, turns instead of crawling. Period 0.5 (T9): x = 0.144, y = 0.161, heading -6 deg. Faster is better; slow period 2 gave x below the predicted 0.1.

